  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-67592f9344aff6ccea244751",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "ωo=1 时线性化倒立摆的对称根轨迹 (SRL)。输出 z 为位置的 2 倍与速度之和。该 SRL 为 0° 根轨迹。当 ρ=1 时，闭环极点位于 -1.36±j0.606，对应于 K=[-2.23 -2.73]。输入增益为 Nx=[1;0]，Nu=1，N̄=-1.23。控制律为 u=-Kx+N̄r。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "SRL for a linearized inverted pendulum with ωo=1. The output z is the sum of twice the position plus the velocity. The SRL is a 0° locus. For ρ=1, the closed-loop poles are at -1.36±j0.606, corresponding to K=[-2.23 -2.73]. The input gains are Nx=[1;0], Nu=1, N̄=-1.23. The control law is u=-Kx+N̄r.",
